      "favourites_count": 2,
      "description": "<p>Made for myself first when Realism was getting worked on. Tried to add unique values that make sense and real weights to items. All guns have working masteries. I tweaked vanilla sights - LPVO’s have a ADS boost across the board and are less sluggish. Optic risers have a slight sight picture speed boost at the cost of accuracy as they do IRL.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/33947-devilflippy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DevilFlippy</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/52449-therkelsen/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Therkelsen</a> ‘s stats from their old patches are included (Epic’s, Massivesoft, WTT)</p>\n<p>It’s not finished, let me know of unbalanced or bugged items. Right now the belts don’t have stats and new ammo is underpowered.</p>\n<p><strong>To do:</strong> Balancing, fix new calibers, LotsOfAmmo support, fix item conflicts and clipping parts.</p>\n<h3><strong>Mods Supported:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2952-wtt-armory/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT- Armory 1.2.1</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2898-ecot-eukyre-s-consortium-of-things/#tab_b0baa820999ad40ec09b5ba454ef01e566027df5\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ECOT - Eukyre’s Consortium of Things 1.1.0</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1764-epic-s-all-in-one/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Epic’s All in One 3.1.4</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1555-tactical-gear-component/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tactical Gear Component 1.2.5</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2943-couturier-gear-and-clothing-pack/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Couturier - gear and clothing pack 1.2.0</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1410-artem/#versions\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Artem 2.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/3002-eco-s-attachment-emporium/#comments\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Eco’s Attachment Emporium 1.0.0  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2867-massivesoft-guns/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft Guns 0.2.0  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1160-kriss-vector-308-assault-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft Vector .308</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/3006-superi-46-4-6x30-smg/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft Superi 46</a> (causing malfunctions currently)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2340/bal-27-57x28-assualt-rifle\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft BAL-27 </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2317/usenko-tr-76-geist-assualt-rifle\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft TR-76</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1345-blackcore/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BlackCore 1.1.8  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2842-echoes-of-tarkov-requisitions/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Echoes of Tarkov - Requisitions 1.0.4  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2175-wtt-taste-the-rainbow/#versions\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Taste the Rainbow 2.0.0  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1790-wtt-pack-n-strap/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Pack ‘n’ Strap 1.1.12</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z9bU8kG.jpeg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z9bU8kG.jpeg\" alt=\"Z9bU8kG.jpeg\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/vtwSJjx.jpeg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vtwSJjx.jpeg\" alt=\"vtwSJjx.jpeg\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Install:</strong> drag user folder into main SPT folder, replace</p>\n",
